# Direct dependencies. requirements.txt is generated by `python -m harness.lock` and pins the
# full transitive set with a hash for every published file. Policy: every published file of
# every pin must be at least 14 days old at lock time (the LiteLLM 1.107.0 lesson).
# Moved from pySigma 1.5.1 + backend 2.0.0 on 2026-11-21. claims.json under both pin
# sets agrees apart from the engine versions.
pySigma==2.0.2
pySigma-backend-sqlite==2.1.1
PyYAML==6.0.3

# pySigma requires diskcache-community (imported as diskcache_community) only for
# sigma.data.mitre_attack and sigma.data.mitre_d3fend, which cache downloaded MITRE data.
# The harness never imports them (self-test 14 checks this), so the package is not
# installed at all. Leaving it out removes the pickle-based cache code entirely.
# lock: exclude diskcache-community - only used by pySigma's MITRE data cache, which the harness never imports
